### thermal units on the zl1 -- what the instrument used to print, and what it prints now
### 2026-09-23, host-side only. The device is in EDL (05c6:9008, port 3-3) for this whole round:
### nothing below is a device measurement except the raw zone values, which are quoted from the
### on-device capture of 2026-09-22 in thermal-2026-09-22.log (section 7) and are marked as such.

===== 1. the raw snapshot this round is built on (measured on the device, 2026-09-22) =====
